 "script": "Burst pipe? Relax. I've got gum.\n\nWhoa! Hey! Come back here!\n\nWater damage and freezing claims average about fifteen thousand four hundred dollars.\n\nSo, is a burst pipe covered? Usually, yes. If you do this.\n\nOne. Shut off the main water valve. Right now.\n\nTwo. Take photos of everything before you clean up.\n\nThree. Read your policy. A sudden burst is usually covered. A slow leak or a flood usually is not. Then call your insurer.\n\nIf Homie can figure it out, so can you.",
